# NOTE: package-lock.json files are intentionally TRACKED (reproducible builds).
# Lock files must use the canonical "https://registry.npmjs.org" host, never the
# internal Nexus host (localhost:7081). npm rewrites the resolved host per-env via
# --registry / .npmrc (replace-registry-host=npmjs), so the same lock works on
# macOS (public registry) and Windows (Nexus). Do NOT commit a lock generated
# against Nexus. See deploy/01-build-extension/README.md.
